y require contextual information that a basic\n  TF-IDF representation cannot fully capture.\n\nThese observations suggest that the model relies on statistical\nassociations between words and target labels, rather than a full\nunderstanding of the tweet context.\n\nThis analysis is exploratory: individual examples help identify\npossible limitations, but they do not establish how frequently\neach issue occurs across the dataset.","metadata":{}}]}